        "id": 2305402144,
        "content": "`assistive-pricing` does not run long tasks and requires to be quite reactive as it handles commands from user, that should preferably receive quick feedback. When running through Actions, it takes ~1 minutes per command to be handled, which is not ideal\r\nThanks to https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquibot-kernel/issues/39 we should be able to run plugins as workers, making them instantaneous.\r\nThus this plugin should be transformed from Action to Worker inside of Cloudflare.",
